@startuml Finanx - Diagrama de Secuencia (Flujo Completo)

title Finanx - Arquitectura y Flujos Principales
caption Diagrama de secuencia general de la aplicación (Android + Spring Boot + Python + RabbitMQ + SeaweedFS + PostgreSQL + Gemini + FCM)

actor "Usuario (App Android)" as User
participant "Android App\n(Finance_UI + MVVM)" as Mobile
participant "Retrofit/OkHttp\n(Auth Interceptor JWT)" as ApiClient
participant "Spring Boot API\n(MisMonedasApplication)" as Backend
participant "AuthController\n/api/v1/auth" as AuthCtrl
participant "ReceiptController\n/api/v1/receipts" as ReceiptCtrl
participant "ImageController\n/api/v1/images" as ImgCtrl
participant "SecurityService" as Security
participant "ReceiptScanService\n(startScan)" as ScanSvc
participant "ImageService" as ImgSvc
participant "ReceiptRepository" as ReceiptRepo
participant "OutboxRepository\n(ReceiptScanOutbox)" as OutboxRepo
participant "ReceiptScanJobDispatcher\n(@Transactional afterCommit)" as JobDisp
participant "ReceiptScanRabbitPublisher" as RabbitPub
participant "RabbitMQ\n(receipt.scan.*)" as Rabbit
participant "Python Doc-Processing\n(app/main.py)" as DocProc
participant "StorageClient (S3)\nSeaweedFS" as Seaweed
participant "OCR (RapidOCR)" as OCR
participant "ReceiptScanResultConsumer" as ResCons
participant "ReceiptScanService\n(applyScanResult)" as ResSvc
participant "RegexParser + GeminiParser" as Parsers
participant "NotificationOutboxPublisher" as NotifPub
participant "RabbitMQ\n(notifications.*)" as NotifRabbit
participant "NotificationConsumer" as NotifCons
participant "FCM Adapter\nFCMNotificationAdapter" as FCM
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

' === 1. AUTENTICACIÓN ===
== 1. Autenticación (Login/Registro/Google) ==

User -> Mobile : Inicia sesión (email/pass o Google)
Mobile -> ApiClient : POST /api/v1/auth/login\no POST /api/v1/auth/register\no POST /api/v1/auth/google
ApiClient -> AuthCtrl : Solicitud con credenciales
AuthCtrl -> Backend : Valida vía AuthService/UserService/GoogleAuthService
Backend -> DB : Verifica/crea usuario, genera JWT
DB --> Backend : Usuario + permisos
Backend --> AuthCtrl : LoginResponse (JWT, usuario)
AuthCtrl --> ApiClient : 200 OK (JWT)
ApiClient --> Mobile : Token JWT
Mobile -> Mobile : Almacena token (TokenStore)\nAgrega Authorization: Bearer en requests

' === 2. ESCANEO DE RECIBOS (FLUJO ASÍNCRONO) ===
== 2. Escaneo de Recibos - Subida y Encolado (Async OCR) ==

User -> Mobile : Captura/selecciona imagen de recibo
Mobile -> ApiClient : POST /api/v1/receipts/scan (MultipartFile: image)\nContent-Type: multipart/form-data
ApiClient -> ReceiptCtrl : scan(image)
ReceiptCtrl -> ReceiptCtrl : Valida (no vacío, <= 5MB)
ReceiptCtrl -> ScanSvc : startScan(imageBytes, filename, mediaType)
ScanSvc -> Security : getCurrentUser() (JWT)
Security -> DB : Obtiene usuario autenticado
DB --> Security : User
Security --> ScanSvc : User

ScanSvc -> ImgSvc : save(user, filename, mediaType, imageBytes)
ImgSvc -> Seaweed : S3 PUT (bucket/objectKey)\n(SigV4 via SeaweedFS S3 API)
Seaweed --> ImgSvc : OK
ImgSvc -> DB : Guarda Image (bucketName, objectKey, tamaño, mime)
DB --> ImgSvc : Image
ImgSvc --> ScanSvc : Image

ScanSvc -> ReceiptRepo : save(Receipt PENDING, user, image)
ReceiptRepo -> DB : INSERT recibo (estado=PENDING)
DB --> ReceiptRepo : Receipt
ReceiptRepo --> ScanSvc : Receipt

ScanSvc -> OutboxRepo : save(ReceiptScanOutbox PENDING, receiptId, bucket, objectKey)
OutboxRepo -> DB : INSERT outbox (estado=PENDING, createdAt)
DB --> OutboxRepo : Outbox
OutboxRepo --> ScanSvc : Outbox

ScanSvc -> JobDisp : publishScanJobAfterCommit(outboxId)\n(registra TransactionSynchronization.afterCommit)
note right of JobDisp: Evita espera del scheduler (30s). Scheduler fallback cada 5s\n(reintentos si falla confirmación RabbitMQ)

ScanSvc --> ReceiptCtrl : ReceiptResponse (receiptId, status=PENDING, imageId, ...)
ReceiptCtrl -> ReceiptCtrl : Construye Location: /api/v1/receipts/{receiptId}
ReceiptCtrl --> ApiClient : 202 Accepted\nLocation + body
ApiClient --> Mobile : 202 Accepted (respuesta)

alt Navegación inmediata + polling (Frontend fix)
  Mobile -> Mobile : ReceiptViewModel navega a ResultScreen\ninmediatamente (no bloquea UI)
  Mobile -> Mobile : Inicia polling en background\n(getScanResult cada ~poll interval)\nMAX_ATTEMPTS 120
end

JobDisp -> JobDisp : afterCommit() ejecutado
JobDisp -> RabbitPub : dispatch(outboxId)
RabbitPub -> OutboxRepo : findById(outboxId)
OutboxRepo -> DB : SELECT outbox
DB --> OutboxRepo : Outbox (PENDING)
RabbitPub -> Rabbit : basicPublish\nexchange=receipt.scan, routingKey=receipt.scan.job\nmessage {receiptId, bucket, objectKey}\n(publisher confirms, mandatory=true)
Rabbit --> RabbitPub : ack/confirm (correlated)
RabbitPub -> OutboxRepo : marcar outbox PUBLISHED + publishedAt
OutboxRepo -> DB : UPDATE estado=PUBLISHED
DB --> OutboxRepo : OK
RabbitPub --> JobDisp : OK

Rabbit -> DocProc : Entrega mensaje a queue receipt.scan.job\n(QoS prefetch)
DocProc -> DocProc : _on_message() parsea JSON
DocProc -> Seaweed : S3 GET (download bucket/objectKey)\nboto3 s3v4 path-style
Seaweed --> DocProc : image bytes
DocProc -> OCR : RapidOCR.recognize(bytes)\n(convierte a RGB, extrae txts/scores)
OCR --> DocProc : OcrResult(raw_text, confidence, duration_ms)
DocProc -> DocProc : _process() → status DONE/FAILED + rawText + engine + confidence
DocProc -> Rabbit : basicPublish\nexchange=receipt.scan.result, routingKey=receipt.scan.result\npayload JSON (ReceiptScanResultMessage)\ndurable, persistent
Rabbit --> DocProc : ACK mensaje job (basic_ack)

' === 3. RESULTADO ASÍNCRONO VUELVE AL BACKEND ===
== 3. Procesamiento de Resultado OCR (Backend Consumer) ==

Rabbit -> ResCons : Entrega a queue receipt.scan.result\n(containerFactory con retry 2x, backoff)
ResCons -> ResCons : Deserializa ReceiptScanResultMessage
ResCons -> ResSvc : applyScanResult(message)
ResSvc -> ReceiptRepo : findByIdForUpdate(receiptId)
ReceiptRepo -> DB : SELECT FOR UPDATE receipt
DB --> ReceiptRepo : Receipt
ReceiptRepo --> ResSvc : Receipt

alt status != "DONE" o terminal
  ResSvc -> ReceiptRepo : markFailed(reason)
  ReceiptRepo -> DB : UPDATE status=FAILED, errorMessage
  DB --> ReceiptRepo : OK
else status == "DONE" y no terminal
  ResSvc -> Parsers : RegexParser.parse(rawText)
  Parsers --> ResSvc : ReceiptData (confidence regex)
  
  alt confidence regex < 0.55
    ResSvc -> Parsers : GeminiParser.parse(rawText) (fallback)
    Parsers --> ResSvc : ReceiptData mejorado (o excepción)
    alt mejoró confianza
      ResSvc -> ResSvc : usar datos Gemini, engine=GEMINI
    else fallback falló
      ResSvc -> ResSvc : log warn, mantener REGEX
    end
  end
  
  alt amount == null
    ResSvc -> ReceiptRepo : fail("No se detectó monto")
    ReceiptRepo -> DB : UPDATE status=FAILED
  else datos válidos
    ResSvc -> DB : Buscar categoría por userId/texto (CategoryRepository)
    DB --> ResSvc : detectedCategoryId (opcional)
    ResSvc -> ReceiptRepo : save(receipt)\nset status=DONE, campos detectados,\nparserEngineUsed, confidenceScore, ocrDurationMs
    ReceiptRepo -> DB : UPDATE receipt COMPLETADO
    DB --> ReceiptRepo : OK
    ResSvc -> ResSvc : log scan_completed
  end
end

ResCons -> ResCons : log scan_result_processed
Rabbit -> ResCons : ACK

' === 4. POLLING DEL RESULTADO DESDE APP ===
== 4. Consulta de Resultado por Polling (App Android) ==

loop Polling reactivo (background, cancelable)
  Mobile -> ApiClient : GET /api/v1/receipts/{receiptId}
  ApiClient -> ReceiptCtrl : getScanResult(receiptId)
  ReceiptCtrl -> ScanSvc : getScanResult(receiptId)
  ScanSvc -> Security : getCurrentUser()
  Security -> DB : userId
  ScanSvc -> ReceiptRepo : findByIdAndUser_Id(receiptId, userId)
  ReceiptRepo -> DB : SELECT receipt por id+userId
  DB --> ReceiptRepo : Receipt
  ReceiptRepo --> ScanSvc : Receipt
  ScanSvc --> ReceiptCtrl : ReceiptResponse (status: PENDING/PROCESSING/DONE/FAILED)
  ReceiptCtrl --> ApiClient : 200 OK
  ApiClient --> Mobile : ReceiptResponse
  
  alt status == DONE
    Mobile -> Mobile : Detiene polling, navega/muestra resultado\ncon datos detectados (monto, fecha, categoría...)
  else status == FAILED
    Mobile -> Mobile : Detiene polling, muestra error
  else PENDING/PROCESSING
    Mobile -> Mobile : Continúa polling (hasta MAX_ATTEMPTS)
  end
end

note over Mobile: Botón "Actualizar estado" permite refresh manual\n(isPollingResult + refreshScanResult())

' === 5. OBTENCIÓN DE IMAGEN (REDIRECT 302 A SEAWEEDFS PRESIGNADO) ===
== 5. Descarga de Imagen (302 + Presigned URL) ==

User -> Mobile : Ver imagen del recibo/resultado
Mobile -> ApiClient : GET /api/v1/images/{imageId}\n(con Authorization Bearer JWT)
ApiClient -> ImgCtrl : download(imageId)
ImgCtrl -> ImgSvc : getPresignedDownloadUrl(imageId)
ImgSvc -> Security : getCurrentUser()
Security -> DB : userId
ImgSvc -> DB : find Image by id + validar ownership (pertenece a user)
DB --> ImgSvc : Image (bucket, objectKey) o null
alt no encontrado o no pertenece
  ImgSvc --> ImgCtrl : Optional.empty()
  ImgCtrl --> ApiClient : 404 Not Found
  ApiClient --> Mobile : Error imagen no encontrada
else válido
  ImgSvc -> Seaweed : Genera presigned URL (GET, TTL corto)\nfirmada con credenciales S3 (SigV4)\nhost público configurado (túnel/ngrok o dominio prod)
  Seaweed --> ImgSvc : URL presignada (temporal)
  ImgSvc --> ImgCtrl : Optional.of(presignedUrl)
  ImgCtrl --> ApiClient : 302 Found\nLocation: <presignedUrl>\nCache-Control: no-store
  ApiClient --> Mobile : 302 Redirect (OkHttp sigue redirect por defecto)
  ApiClient -> Seaweed : GET <presignedUrl> (sin Authorization)
  Seaweed --> ApiClient : 200 OK image/jpeg (bytes)
  ApiClient --> Mobile : bytes de imagen
  Mobile -> Mobile : Muestra imagen en UI
end

note right of Seaweed: Redirect cruza host (móvil accede a storage público).\nCabecera Authorization NO se reenvía a storage.\nSigV4 en URL; TTL corto (5m).

' === 6. NOTIFICACIONES (FCM) - OPCIONAL ===
== 6. Notificaciones Asíncronas (FCM/Gmail) ==

Backend -> NotifPub : Publica evento de notificación (outbox)\n(NotificationOutboxRabbitPublisher)
NotifPub -> NotifRabbit : exchange=notifications, routingKey=notifications.send\nmensaje NotificationOutboxMessage
NotifRabbit -> NotifCons : Consume queue notifications.send\n(retry + DLQ)
NotifCons -> NotifCons : deliveryService.prepare → obtiene DTO
NotifCons -> FCM : Envia notificación vía FCMNotificationAdapter\n(tokens registrados por usuario)
FCM --> NotifCons : Resultado envío
NotifCons -> NotifCons : complete() marca outbox procesado

' === 7. WEBHOOKS DE PAGO (EXTERNO) ===
== 7. Webhooks de Pago (Asíncronos) ==

ExternalSystem -> Backend : POST /webhooks/payment\n(WebhookController)
Backend -> PaymentWebhookRabbitPublisher : Publica a exchange payment.webhooks
Rabbit -> PaymentWebhookConsumer : Consume y procesa webhook\n(actualiza suscripción/pago)
PaymentWebhookConsumer -> DB : Actualiza estado de pago/suscripción
DB --> PaymentWebhookConsumer : OK

' === 8. FLUJO COMPLETO RESUMIDO (TIEMPOS CLAVE) ===
== Notas de Implementación (Fixes aplicados) ==

note over JobDisp, ScanSvc: **Fix Bug 1 (scan "procesando" largo):**\n- Immediate publish via afterCommit (REQUIRES_NEW dispatcher)\n- Scheduler fallback 5s (antes 30s), lock times reducidos\n- Resultado: outbox→publish ~0.04s vs 15–29s

note over ResSvc: **Fallback Gemini:** solo si regex < 0.55\nEngine final: REGEX o GEMINI\nSi monto no detectado → FAILED

note over NotifCons, FCM: **Fix Bug 2 (DELETE FCM 500):**\n- Repositorio usa deleteByIdAndUserId (bulk @Modifying)\n- Service remove() idempotente (204 incluso si no existe)\n- Evita StaleState/ObjectOptimisticLocking en deletes concurrentes

note over Mobile, ApiClient: **Polling no bloqueante:** navegación inmediata a resultado\npolling reactivo en background, cancelable, 120 intentos

@enduml